# Story 10.1 — repo-root build context (infra/Dockerfile.web). Keep the
# upload lean and secrets/tooling out of the daemon context; the final web
# stage only receives dist/ + Caddyfile, but the CONTEXT should still never
# carry .git, envs, or a Windows node_modules tree.
.git/
**/node_modules/
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/__pycache__/
**/dist/
.env
.env.*
data/
output/
PRPs/
docs/
components/api/
components/frontend/
components/frontend-spectr/
components/worker/
components/shared/
components/analysis/
components/bff/
